# Project Overview

Next.js 15 (App Router) demo showcasing Turnkey embedded wallet with multiple auth methods.

## Stack

- **Runtime**: Next.js 15, React 19, TypeScript (strict)
- **Auth**: Turnkey SDK (passkeys, OAuth via Google/Apple/Facebook, email OTP, wallet import)
- **Blockchain**: Ethereum Sepolia via Viem + Alchemy SDK
- **UI**: shadcn/ui (Radix primitives), Tailwind CSS v4 (CSS-first config)
- **Validation**: Zod schemas, `@t3-oss/env-nextjs` for env vars
- **Package manager**: pnpm 8.9

## Provider Hierarchy

```
ThemeProvider > TurnkeyProvider > AuthProvider
```

All providers live in `src/providers/`. The root layout wraps children with `<Providers>`.

## Route Groups

- `(landing)` - Unauthenticated: home, email auth, OAuth callbacks
- `(dashboard)` - Authenticated: wallet dashboard, settings

## Key Patterns

- Server actions in `src/actions/` with `"use server"` directive
- Type-safe env via `src/env.mjs` (never access `process.env` directly)
- Path alias: `@/*` maps to `./src/*`
- Components organized by feature in `src/components/`, primitives in `src/components/ui/`
- One sub-organization per user with an auto-created Ethereum wallet
